Ab SaleActivity.kt update karta hoon taake save hone ke baad ye preview screen khule.

Ab manifest mein `BillPreviewActivity` register karta hoon:

**Sale side ka Bill Preview ready hai** — 3 files hain:

1. **BillPreviewActivity.kt (naya)** — Sale save hone ke baad khulta hai: green header ("Sale Saved" + invoice no.), receipt-style card (shop name/address/phone, items list, subtotal/discount/total/paid/balance), aur do buttons: **🖨️ PRINT** (Settings mein select ki hui printer use karta hai) aur **✓ DONE**
2. **SaleActivity.kt** — save hone ke baad ab seedha `MainActivity` par wapas jaane ki bajaye ye naya preview screen khulta hai
3. **AndroidManifest.xml** — `BillPreviewActivity` register ki hai

**Ab Purchase side ke liye:** aap ne pehle ReportsActivity.kt dobara bhej di thi — mujhe abhi bhi **PurchaseActivity.kt** ka current content chahiye taake:
- Purchase save hone ke baad bhi yehi preview screen khule (BillPreviewActivity already generic hai, dono ke liye kaam karega)
- "Firm Name" ka Settings shop-name se sync na hone wala masla fix ho sake
